    {
      "id": "201f2f50086a45189b93ee8c65ff98f6",
      "source": "# 叠加波形：不同频率正弦合成方波\n# 傅里叶级数：方波 f(x) = (4/π)Σ_{k odd} sin(kωt)/k\n# 谐波项越多越逼近方波，间断点附近出现吉布斯过冲（约 9%）\ndef fourier_square(t, n_terms):\n    s = np.zeros_like(t)\n    for k in range(1, 2 * n_terms, 2):\n        s += sin(2 * pi * k * t) / k\n    return (4 / pi) * s\n\nt = linspace(0, 1, 400)\nplot(t, fourier_square(t, 3), title=\"方波的傅里叶级数合成\", xlabel=\"时间 t (s)\", ylabel=\"f(t)\", label=\"3 项\")\nplot(t, fourier_square(t, 10), label=\"10 项\")\nplot(t, fourier_square(t, 50), label=\"50 项\")\n",
      "execution_count": 3,
