      "source": "# 带通滤波：去除噪声恢复纯净信号\n# 对频谱做掩码（仅保留 40-130Hz），再逆 FFT 回到时域\nmask = (abs(freqs) >= 40) & (abs(freqs) <= 130)\nX_filtered = X.copy()\nX_filtered[~mask] = 0.0\nx_filtered = np.real(np.fft.ifft(X_filtered))\nplot(t[:100], x[:100], title=\"带通滤波恢复纯净信号\", xlabel=\"时间 t (s)\", ylabel=\"幅值\", label=\"原始（含噪）\")\nplot(t[:100], x_filtered[:100], label=\"滤波后\")\n",
